<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Security+ Comptia study guide</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Share+Tech+Mono&family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@400;600;700;900&family=Barlow:wght@400;500&display=swap');
  :root {
    --od-green: #1f4b63; --tan: #7fb8c9; --tan-light: #d6f0f5; --black: #05080a;
    --dark: #0f1a1f; --darker: #0a1216; --accent: #22d3ee; --red: #c0392b;
    --green: #2ecc71; --muted: #4f7080; --card-bg: #101c22; --border: #24343d;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    background: var(--darker); color: var(--tan-light);
    font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif; min-height: 100vh;
    background-image:
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 40px, rgba(31,75,99,0.03) 40px, rgba(31,75,99,0.03) 41px),
      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, transparent 40px, rgba(31,75,99,0.03) 40px, rgba(31,75,99,0.03) 41px);
  }
  .topbar { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
  header {
    background: var(--dark); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--od-green);
    padding: 14px 18px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
  }
  .header-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; min-width: 0; }

  /* Hamburger */
  .hamburger { background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--border); width: 42px; height: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 5px; cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0; transition: border-color 0.15s; }
  .hamburger:hover, .hamburger:focus-visible { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .hamburger span { display: block; width: 20px; height: 2px; background: var(--accent); transition: transform 0.2s, opacity 0.2s; }
  .hamburger.open span:nth-child(1) { transform: translateY(7px) rotate(45deg); }
  .hamburger.open span:nth-child(2) { opacity: 0; }
  .hamburger.open span:nth-child(3) { transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg); }

  /* Slide-down nav drawer */
  .nav-drawer { background: var(--dark); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); overflow: hidden; max-height: 0; transition: max-height 0.25s ease; }
  .nav-drawer.open { max-height: 340px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--od-green); }
  .nav-inner { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 6px 0; }
  .nav-item { background: transparent; border: none; border-left: 3px solid transparent; color: var(--tan-light); text-align: left; padding: 12px 20px; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; transition: background 0.15s; }
  .nav-item:hover { background: rgba(31,75,99,0.25); }
  .nav-item.active { border-left-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); background: rgba(31,75,99,0.2); }
  .nav-item .nav-sub { font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; color: var(--muted); }
  .nav-item.active .nav-sub { color: var(--tan); }
  .current-view-tag { font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--accent); letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .unit-tag { font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--accent); letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .date-tag { font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); text-align: right; }

  .score-bar { display: flex; gap: 16px; padding: 8px 18px; background: var(--dark); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
  .score-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .score-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .dot-correct { background: var(--green); } .dot-wrong { background: var(--red); } .dot-skip { background: var(--muted); }
  .reset-btn { margin-left: auto; background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--muted); font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; padding: 3px 10px; cursor: pointer; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .reset-btn:hover { border-color: var(--red); color: var(--red); }

  .main { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 16px; }
  .view { display: none; }
  .view.active { display: block; }

  .topic-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(210px, 1fr)); gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .topic-btn { background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--tan-light); font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.5px; padding: 10px 14px; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; transition: all 0.15s; position: relative; }
  .topic-btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .topic-btn.active { background: var(--od-green); border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .topic-btn .reg-tag { display: block; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .topic-btn.active .reg-tag { color: var(--tan); }
  .topic-btn .count-tag { font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; color: var(--muted); float: right; }

  .station-group-label { font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--accent); letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 18px 0 8px; border-left: 3px solid var(--od-green); padding-left: 10px; }

  .card-container { perspective: 1000px; margin-bottom: 16px; scroll-margin-top: 130px; }
  .card { background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-left: 4px solid var(--od-green); min-height: 220px; padding: 28px; position: relative; transition: border-color 0.2s; }
  .card.revealed { border-left-color: var(--accent); }
  .card.correct-card { border-left-color: var(--green); }
  .card.wrong-card { border-left-color: var(--red); }
  .card-topic { font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .card-q { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--tan-light); margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .card-a { display: none; background: rgba(31,75,99,0.2); border: 1px solid var(--od-green); padding: 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--tan); }
  .card-a.show { display: block; }
  .card-a strong { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .reveal-btn { background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--od-green); color: var(--tan); font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px; padding: 10px 20px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .reveal-btn:hover { background: var(--od-green); color: var(--accent); }
  /* Bottom control deck — all answer actions live here */
  .control-deck { position: sticky; bottom: 0; background: var(--darker); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 12px 0 14px; margin-top: 4px; z-index: 80; }
  .deck-label { font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .action-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .action-row + .action-row { margin-top: 10px; }
  .btn { flex: 1; min-width: 100px; padding: 12px; border: none; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; transition: opacity 0.15s; }
  .btn:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
  .btn-correct { background: var(--green); color: var(--black); }
  .btn-wrong { background: var(--red); color: white; }
  .btn-skip { background: var(--muted); color: var(--dark); }
  .btn-next { background: var(--accent); color: var(--black); }
  .btn:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .section-label { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .progress-bar-wrap { background: var(--dark); height: 4px; margin-bottom: 20px; position: relative; }
  .progress-bar-fill { height: 100%; background: var(--accent); transition: width 0.3s; }
  .weak-topics { background: rgba(192,57,43,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(192,57,43,0.3); padding: 14px 18px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .weak-label { font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--red); letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .weak-list { font-size: 13px; color: var(--tan); line-height: 1.8; }
  .info-box { background: rgba(34,211,238,0.07); border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.2); padding: 14px 18px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--tan); }
  .separator { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin: 20px 0; }
  .footer-credit { text-align: center; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 1px; padding: 20px 16px 28px; font-style: italic; }
  .version-tag { font-style: normal; color: var(--accent); margin-left: 10px; padding: 1px 7px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 3px; font-size: 10px; }

  /* Reference tables (AR / FM-DA / Memorize tabs) */
  .ref-intro { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--tan); margin-bottom: 18px; }
  table.ref { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 14px; }
  table.ref th { background: var(--od-green); color: var(--tan-light); font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; text-align: left; padding: 10px 12px; }
  table.ref td { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 10px 12px; vertical-align: top; color: var(--tan); }
  table.ref td.code { font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; color: var(--accent); white-space: nowrap; font-size: 13px; }
  table.ref tr:hover td { background: rgba(31,75,99,0.12); }

  /* Memorize tab */
  .creed-block { background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-left: 4px solid var(--od-green); padding: 20px 24px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .creed-title { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--accent); letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .creed-body { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--tan-light); }
  .creed-body p { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .creed-body strong { color: var(--accent); }
  .hide-toggle { background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--od-green); color: var(--tan); font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1px; padding: 4px 10px; cursor: pointer; float: right; }
  .hide-toggle:hover { color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .creed-body.blurred { filter: blur(5px); user-select: none; }

  /* Study Guide — nested accordion */
  .sg-station { background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-left: 4px solid var(--od-green); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .sg-station[open] { border-left-color: var(--accent); }
  .sg-station > summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; padding: 14px 44px 14px 16px; position: relative; display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .sg-station > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .sg-station > summary::after { content: '+'; position: absolute; right: 16px; top: 12px; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 18px; color: var(--accent); }
  .sg-station[open] > summary::after { content: '–'; }
  .sg-station > summary:hover { background: rgba(31,75,99,0.18); }
  .sg-station-name { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); }
  .sg-station-sub { font-size: 12px; color: var(--tan); }
  .sg-count { font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); margin-left: auto; padding-right: 6px; }
  .sg-station-body { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 4px 0; }
  .sg-intro { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; padding: 10px 16px; }

  .sg-topic { border-top: 1px solid rgba(58,61,50,0.6); }
  .sg-topic:first-child { border-top: none; }
  .sg-topic > summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; padding: 11px 40px 11px 16px; position: relative; }
  .sg-topic > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .sg-topic > summary::after { content: '›'; position: absolute; right: 18px; top: 9px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; transition: transform 0.15s; display: inline-block; }
  .sg-topic[open] > summary::after { transform: rotate(90deg); color: var(--accent); }
  .sg-topic > summary:hover { background: rgba(31,75,99,0.14); }
  .sg-topic[open] > summary { background: rgba(31,75,99,0.2); }
  .sg-topic-name { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--tan-light); }
  .sg-topic[open] .sg-topic-name { color: var(--accent); }

  .sg-body { padding: 6px 18px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--tan); }
  .sg-body p { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .sg-body strong { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .sg-body em { color: var(--tan-light); }
  .sg-body ul, .sg-body ol { margin: 0 0 12px 20px; }
  .sg-body li { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .sg-body h3 { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--tan-light); border-left: 3px solid var(--od-green); padding-left: 8px; margin: 16px 0 8px; }
  .sg-body h4 { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: var(--tan); margin: 12px 0 6px; }
  .sg-body a { color: var(--accent); word-break: break-all; }
  .sg-body hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin: 14px 0; }
  .sg-flag { background: rgba(192,57,43,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(192,57,43,0.35); padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 14px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .sg-flag-label { display: block; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--red); letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .sg-flag strong { color: var(--tan-light); }

  .reveal-btn { flex: 2; min-width: 140px; background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--od-green); color: var(--tan); padding: 12px; }
  .reveal-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { background: var(--od-green); color: var(--accent); opacity: 1; }
  .btn-secondary { flex: 1; min-width: 90px; }
  :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    h1 { font-size: 18px; }
    .date-tag { display: none; }
    .card { padding: 20px; min-height: 180px; }
    .card-q { font-size: 22px; }
    .main { padding: 18px 12px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    * { transition: none !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="topbar">
<header>
  <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-drawer">
    <span></span><span></span><span></span>
  </button>
  <div class="header-left">
    <h1>Security+ Comptia study guide</h1>
    <span class="current-view-tag" id="current-view-tag">FLASHCARDS</span>
  </div>
  <div class="date-tag" id="date-tag">LAST UPDATED: —<br>TARGET DATE: SET YOUR OWN</div>
</header>

<nav class="nav-drawer" id="nav-drawer">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <button class="nav-item active" data-view="flashcards">Flashcards <span class="nav-sub">Drill by category and topic</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-view="guide">Study Guide <span class="nav-sub">Full guide, expand by category</span></button>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="score-bar" id="score-bar">
  <span class="score-item"><span class="score-dot dot-correct"></span><span id="score-correct">0</span> CORRECT</span>
  <span class="score-item"><span class="score-dot dot-wrong"></span><span id="score-wrong">0</span> WRONG</span>
  <span class="score-item"><span class="score-dot dot-skip"></span><span id="score-skip">0</span> SKIPPED</span>
  <span class="score-item" style="color: var(--accent); font-size:11px;" id="current-topic-tag">— SELECT TOPIC —</span>
  <button class="reset-btn" onclick="resetScores()">RESET</button>
</div>
</div>

<div class="main">

  <!-- ============ FLASHCARDS VIEW ============ -->
  <div class="view active" id="view-flashcards">
    <div class="section-label">Select Topic</div>
    <div class="topic-grid" id="topic-grid"></div>
    <hr class="separator">
    <div class="progress-bar-wrap"><div class="progress-bar-fill" id="progress-bar" style="width:0%"></div></div>
    <div class="card-container">
      <div class="card" id="main-card">
        <div class="card-topic" id="card-topic">— SELECT A TOPIC ABOVE —</div>
        <div class="card-q" id="card-q">Choose a topic from the list above to begin.</div>
        <div class="card-a" id="card-a"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="weak-topics" id="weak-section" style="display:none">
      <div class="weak-label">▲ WEAK AREAS — NEEDS WORK</div>
      <div class="weak-list" id="weak-list"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="control-deck">
      <div class="deck-label" id="deck-label">Answer out loud, then reveal</div>
      <div class="action-row" id="reveal-row">
        <button class="btn reveal-btn" id="reveal-btn" onclick="revealAnswer()" disabled>REVEAL ANSWER</button>
        <button class="btn btn-skip btn-secondary" onclick="skipCard()" id="skip-btn" disabled>SKIP</button>
      </div>
      <div class="action-row" id="judge-row" style="display:none">
        <button class="btn btn-correct" onclick="markCard('correct')">✓ GOT IT</button>
        <button class="btn btn-wrong" onclick="markCard('wrong')">✗ MISSED</button>
      </div>
      <div class="action-row" id="next-row" style="display:none">
        <button class="btn btn-next" onclick="nextCard()" id="next-btn">NEXT →</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============ STUDY GUIDE VIEW ============ -->
  <div class="view" id="view-guide">
    <p class="ref-intro">Your full study guide, straight from the source file. Tap a station to open it, then tap a topic to read it. Everything starts closed so you can work one station at a time.</p>
    <div id="guide-content">

<details class="sg-station" open><summary><span class="sg-station-name">Category 1</span><span class="sg-station-sub">CompTIA Security+ SY0-701 acronyms, expanded</span><span class="sg-count">12 topics</span></summary><div class="sg-station-body"><p class="sg-intro">Subjects: Cloud &amp; Virtualization, Cryptography &amp; PKI, Data Protection &amp; Privacy, Email &amp; Messaging, Endpoint, Host &amp; Application, Governance, Risk &amp; Compliance, Identity &amp; Access Management, Network &amp; Infrastructure, Physical &amp; Environmental, Security Operations &amp; Monitoring, Threats, Attacks &amp; Malware, Wireless &amp; Mobile.</p><details class="sg-topic"><summary><span class="sg-topic-name">Cloud &amp; Virtualization</span></summary><div class="sg-body"><ul><li><strong>CASB</strong> — Cloud Access Security Broker</li>
<li><strong>CSP</strong> — Cloud Service Provider</li>
<li><strong>IaaS</strong> — Infrastructure as a Service</li>
<li><strong>IaC</strong> — Infrastructure as Code</li>
<li><strong>MaaS</strong> — Monitoring as a Service</li>
<li><strong>PaaS</strong> — Platform as a Service</li>
<li><strong>SaaS</strong> — Software as a Service</li>
<li><strong>VDI</strong> — Virtual Desktop Infrastructure</li>
<li><strong>VM</strong> — Virtual Machine</li>
<li><strong>VPC</strong> — Virtual Private Cloud</li></ul></div></details><details class="sg-topic"><summary><span class="sg-topic-name">Cryptography &amp; PKI</span></summary><div class="sg-body"><ul><li><strong>AES</strong> — Advanced Encryption Standard</li>
<li><strong>AES-256</strong> — Advanced Encryption Standard 256-bit</li>
<li><strong>CA</strong> — Certificate Authority</li>
<li><strong>CBC</strong> — Cipher Block Chaining</li>
<li><strong>CFB</strong> — Cipher Feedback</li>
<li><strong>CRL</strong> — Certificate Revocation List</li>
<li><strong>CSR</strong> — Certificate Signing Request</li>
<li><strong>DES</strong> — Data Encryption Standard</li>
<li><strong>DHE</strong> — Diffie-Hellman Ephemeral</li>
<li><strong>DSA</strong> — Digital Signature Algorithm</li>
<li><strong>ECB</strong> — Electronic Codebook</li>
<li><strong>ECC</strong> — Elliptic Curve Cryptography</li>
<li><strong>ECDHE</strong> — Elliptic Curve Diffie-Hellman Ephemeral</li>
<li><strong>ECDSA</strong> — Elliptic Curve Digital Signature Algorithm</li>
<li><strong>GCM</strong> — Galois/Counter Mode</li>
<li><strong>GPG</strong> — GNU Privacy Guard</li>
<li><strong>HMAC</strong> — Hash-based Message Authentication Code</li>
<li><strong>HSM</strong> — Hardware Security Module</li>
<li><strong>IKE</strong> — Internet Key Exchange</li>
<li><strong>IPSec</strong> — Internet Protocol Security</li>
<li><strong>IV</strong> — Initialization Vector</li>
<li><strong>KEK</strong> — Key Encryption Key</li>
<li><strong>MAC</strong> — Message Authentication Code <em>(message authentication context)</em></li>
<li><strong>OCSP</strong> — Online Certificate Status Protocol</li>
<li><strong>OID</strong> — Object Identifier</li>
<li><strong>PEM</strong> — Privacy Enhanced Mail</li>
<li><strong>PFS</strong> — Perfect Forward Secrecy</li>
<li><strong>PKCS</strong> — Public Key Cryptography Standards</li>
<li><strong>PKI</strong> — Public Key Infrastructure</li>
<li><strong>RA</strong> — Registration Authority</li>
<li><strong>RC4</strong> — Rivest Cipher 4</li>
<li><strong>RSA</strong> — Rivest-Shamir-Adleman</li>
<li><strong>SHA</strong> — Secure Hash Algorithm</li>
<li><strong>SSL</strong> — Secure Sockets Layer</li>
<li><strong>TLS</strong> — Transport Layer Security</li>
